<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		357.39		vs	  334.44</p>
<p> Operating	   11.87		vs	    8.31</p>
<p> Current	     14.30		vs	   11.24</p>
<p> Net		    8.54		vs	    6.80</p>
<p> EPS		   12.01 yen	  vs	    9.57 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    711 million	  vs	 711 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Electric Industries Ltd is a major electric wire and cable maker.</p>
